# What the Docker build of deploy/docker/Dockerfile never needs (build context: the repository's root, compose.yaml).
# The Dockerfile copies only named files (requirements, config.py, app, migrations ...), so nothing of this ends up in
# the image anyway; left out here, it never even goes to the Docker daemon (audit 2026-10-13, DP-11): secrets
# (.env and the like, keys, dumps), the git history, local databases and uploads, tests and caches.
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.asc
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/netcup.ini
instance
uploads
deploy/docker/nginx-live
tests
tools/**
!tools/build_static.py
!tools/storage_backup_lock.py
concepts
docs
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
